{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434130/extras/94325ded78ea9021fdced9070ad03ddd.poster.avif?t=1761932799\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434130/extras/94325ded78ea9021fdced9070ad03ddd.webm?t=1761932799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434130/extras/94325ded78ea9021fdced9070ad03ddd.mp4?t=1761932799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on an Epic Culinary Adventure with Lanya, the Legendary Hero's Daughter!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One peaceful day, while running a restaurant with her retired parents, <br>Lanya is suddenly engulfed by a strange light and transported to another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land she crash-lands in is cursed by the gods, where cooking has been forbidden.<br>Immune to the gods\u2019 curse, Lanya becomes the only chef in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show the people a variety of flavors in this land where cooking is banned, reclaim the freedom of taste stolen by the gods, and embark on a journey to find your way home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt, Eat, and Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each field is home to its own unique monsters. <br>Hunt them to gather ingredients, and collect resources through logging and mining to continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The \u201cGifts\u201d earned in battle grant you temporary strength during expeditions but vanish once you return. <br>However, the resources you bring back can be used to strengthen your weapons and crafting, allowing you to grow little by little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short expeditions and small victories will accumulate into the strength you need to venture further into the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Are the Only Chef in This World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434130/extras/e292c631e3988007d7b46ffa7124ba20.poster.avif?t=1761932799\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434130/extras/e292c631e3988007d7b46ffa7124ba20.webm?t=1761932799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434130/extras/e292c631e3988007d7b46ffa7124ba20.mp4?t=1761932799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for expeditions or craft snacks at camps scattered throughout the land. Choose your ingredients freely and create your own recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember\u2014Lanya has a small appetite and can\u2019t eat much at once. <br>Keep an eye on <strong>Fullness</strong> when preparing snacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snacks can provide various buffs, and special snacks found during expeditions may grant unique effects when eaten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434130/extras/cc70274e4cfcb29156259c19f7484faf.poster.avif?t=1761932799\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434130/extras/cc70274e4cfcb29156259c19f7484faf.webm?t=1761932799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434130/extras/cc70274e4cfcb29156259c19f7484faf.mp4?t=1761932799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your journey ends, use the leftover ingredients to serve meals to the people. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill steaks the traditional way, roast skewers, or simmer hearty soups to win over your customers. <br>The money you earn will become the fuel that drives your next adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenge the Gods of Taste!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434130/extras/9c160173934c65e11de4ac14b70f318c.avif?t=1761932799\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the Gods of Taste strip people of the joy of flavor and cooking?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the guardians that protect them, confront the gods themselves, and uncover the hidden secrets of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim the freedom of cooking, and set out on the journey that may reveal the way for Lanya to return to her original world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434130?t=1761932799","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434130?t=1761932799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434130/d4ad6f77f8aaf800c80d27871b2fefb4ad47220d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761932799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434130/d4ad6f77f8aaf800c80d27871b2fefb4ad47220d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761932799","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3447130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class